    "description": "<p>Make an Interface Roll to unleash a<br>blast of burning flare shells against all<br>adversaries within Far range.<br>On a success, spend any number of<br>Hope and force that many targets you<br>succeeded against to make a Reaction<br>Roll (14).<br>Targets who succeed take 3d20+3<br>techno damage. Targets who fail take<br>4d20+5 techno damage and are<br>temporarily Blinded. While Blinded,<br>they has disadvantage on attack rolls<br>and can’t target anything beyond Close<br>range unless they can perceive it<br>through another sense.</p>",
